[00:01.00] 作曲 : Morgan Wallen/Blake Pendergrass/Chase McGill/Ryan Vojtesak/Ernest Keith Smith/Michael Hardy
[00:11.40]Everything's still pretty much the same 'round here
[00:11.40]这里的全部 似乎都与往常如出一辙
[00:17.40]Neighbors still shooting all of next year's deer
[00:17.40]邻居们仍在猎取下一年的野鹿
[00:23.05]Boys still lose 'less they're playing at home
[00:23.05]男孩们主场之外仍常败北
[00:28.63]But I got better since you got gone
[00:28.63]但你走后 我已逐渐好转
[00:33.85]I'm still a few too many on a Friday night
[00:33.85]周五夜晚仍会小酌几杯
[00:39.40]I still try to step in when it ain't my fight
[00:39.40]仍会插手不属于我的纷争
[00:45.44]I'm still me, don't get me wrong
